#: kcmfontinst/KCmFontInst.cpp:393
msgid ""
"<h1>Font Installer</h1><p> This module allows you to install TrueType, "
"Type1, Speedo, and Bitmap fonts.</p><p>You may also install fonts using "
"Konqueror: type fonts:/ into Konqueror's location bar and this will display "
"your installed fonts. To install a font, simply copy one into the "
"appropriate folder.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: kcmfontinst/KCmFontInst.cpp:399
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> As you are not logged in as \"root\", any fonts installed "
"will only be available to you. To install fonts system wide, use the "
"\"Administrator Mode\" button to run this module as \"root\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>PERHATIAN:</b> Memandangkan anda tidak log masuk sebagai \"root\", mana-mana "
"font dipasang hanya ada untuk anda. Untuk memasang font bagi keseluruhan sistem, guna "
"butang \"Mod Pentadbir\" untuk laksakan modul ini sebagai \"root\".</p>"

